    a: "Traditional study abroad agents earn 10% to 20% commission by directing students to private colleges in the UK, Canada, Poland, or Latvia where tuition runs ₹15-30 Lakhs per year. Finesse works strictly for the student: we target world-ranked state universities charging ₹0 tuition in Germany or 100% funded Italian scholarships, operating on a transparent, upfront counseling model."
  },
  {
    q: "Where is Finesse Overseas Education located in Kolhapur?",
    a: "Our counseling headquarters is located at Samarth Sakshi Plaza, First Floor, Above Sohala Showroom, Beside Lenskart, 4th Lane, Rajarampuri, Kolhapur, Maharashtra 416008. Students and parents are welcome for in-person counseling from Monday to Saturday, 10:30 AM to 6:30 PM."
  },
  {
    q: "Can Indian students get 100% scholarships to study in Italy from Kolhapur?",
    a: "Yes. Through the Italian government's DSU / ISEE Parificato regional scholarship schemes, eligible students get their entire tuition waived and receive an annual maintenance stipend between €7,400 and €8,400, covering hostel and food expenses completely."
  },
  {
    q: "What European medical universities comply with NMC FMGL 2021 regulations?",
    a: "Under the NMC FMGL Regulations 2021, foreign medical degrees must feature a minimum 54 months course + 12 months integrated internship in the same campus, taught 100% in English, and granting full license to practice. Finesse audits every medical university curriculum to ensure 100% compliance with NMC and NEXT requirements."
  }
];
